(Kampong Thom): Major General Som Sun, Commander of Kampong Thom Military Operation Area and Chairman of the Kampong Thom Provincial Veterans Association, handed over two new houses donated by Samdech Techo Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian Veterans Association, to two disabled veterans. Family through General Kun Kim, Senior Minister, Vice President and Secretary General of the Cambodian Veterans Association.
And House 2: The back of House 163 was handed over to Lt. Puy Vannak, 69, a former police officer of Prasat Balong District Police Inspectorate, who retired in 2008 and his wife Hong Kun, 62, with family in 6 people living in Khmak village, Sala Visay commune, Prasat Balong district, Kampong Thom province.
