It is estimated that Kampot province still has about 30% of the area that has not yet been measured. Therefore, the provincial governor urged the relevant and relevant officials and local authorities to cooperate to complete the land registration work as soon as possible in order to hand over the title to the landowners with peace of mind and to be able to take advantage of their land. Body to its full potential.
