(Preah Vihear): Mr. Lim Kean Hor, Minister of Water Resources and Meteorology, on June 24, 2020, accompanied by the Secretary of State, Undersecretary of State and Technical Officers of the Ministry, together with the Board of Governors of Preah Vihear Province, inspected the reservoir development project. Along Stung Sen, the left dam is in Putra commune, Chey Sen district, and the right dam is in Reaksa commune, Rovieng district.
