It should be noted that after the construction, the reservoir dam can store about 256.9 million cubic meters of water and can supply irrigation water to increase agricultural products on an area of about 143,323 hectares in the rainy season and about 22,878 Hectares in the dry season (Reaksa Reservoir dam is located in Preah Vihear province, but most of the irrigation possibilities are in Kampong Thom province).
At the same time, the Reaksa Reservoir Dam has made a significant contribution to flood mitigation and water supply in some areas in the lower reaches, as well as serving the tourism sector.
