This is the second royal gift for the King of Cambodia and the Queen Mother of Cambodia. Last March, the two also agreed to raise $ 300,000 for the Royal Government to use in the fight against the 19 Kovid disease that is spreading in Cambodia.
It should be noted that in order to participate in the fight against Kovid 19 disease that is spreading in Cambodia, the heads of the nation's top institutions include Samdech Vibol Sena Pheakdey Say Chhum, President of the Senate, Samdech Ponhea Chakrei Heng Samrin, President of the National Assembly, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia. Cambodian Armed Forces civil servants have also donated their salaries for several months to the National Commission for Combating Kovid 19.
