Four durians sent from Thailand riot in German city, 12 people taken to hospital
(Germany): Twelve German postal workers have been treated, while many others have been evacuated due to a suspicious package of odors, but they are hard to resist, but in reality it is just Package contains only durian fruit. This was released by CNN on Wednesday, June 23, 2020.
Police and paramedics were dispatched to a post office in Schweinfurt, Bavaria, on Saturday last week after staff noticed a strange odor coming from a package.
In addition, six ambulances were dispatched to the scene and firefighters from three different departments were also present. Twelve postal workers complained of nausea and were taken to hospital, Schweinfurt police said.
Carefully inspected to technical standards, it was a package containing four durians from Thailand, which a 50-year-old resident sent to a friend's house in Nuremberg, and finally a package containing durians. That is delivered to its destination.
This frightening fruit is very popular throughout Southeast Asia, but due to its strange appearance and unique smell, many people do not like it, especially in the West. . In addition, many people in Europe even liken durian to rotten food or rotten socks.
