Remarks by Samdech Techo Hun Sen on the Implementation of the Cash Giving Program for Poor and Vulnerable People 19
(Phnom Penh): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, on the morning of June 24, 2020, announced the implementation of a program to provide cash to about 600,000 poor and vulnerable people with Kovid 19 disease. The ceremony will take place at the Peace Palace.
The 19 global epidemics of Kovid are causing a severe economic crisis. For Cambodia as well, the economy has experienced an unprecedented deficit in the last 20 years. Cambodians are also suffering because of 19 Kovid disease, which causes them to lose their monthly income.
On the occasion of announcing the implementation of the cash program, Samdech Techo Hun Sen spoke for more than an hour. The following are the main contents of Samdech Techo Hun Sen:
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Kovid disease not only caused the deaths of people but also caused serious economic damage.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Kovid 19 disease makes it easy for people to return to poverty.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that although Cambodia was able to control the situation of Kovid 19, it was still in a precarious situation.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Royal Government, through the Economic and Financial Policy Committee, regularly monitors and evaluates the situation and launches a series of economic and social measures to help maintain business balance and support workers' livelihoods. As well as supporting the income of the people based on the principle of "help intervene in the sector and the people most affected."
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in the field of social affairs, the Royal Government has already launched a cash project for the development of rural infrastructure and support for farmers, the program has been extended to 18 target provinces and will be implemented until 2022.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in 2020, the Royal Government has decided to increase the budget for this project from about $ 38 million to about $ 100 million.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in 2020, this project will provide people who have lost their jobs and return to their hometowns (both inside and outside the country) as well as people living in the community have the opportunity to get jobs. Short-term with income to support daily living in the amount of up to nearly 1 million people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the cash support program for poor and vulnerable families during Kovid-19 was made with the main purpose of the Royal Government in launching this program to facilitate the lives of people who have Poverty will be affected by Kovid-19, including those who have lost their jobs or lost their income to fall back into poverty.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the launch of this program clearly shows that the Royal Government, if "dare to speak, dare to do" and do it with the utmost precision and caution.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that through this program, the Royal Government will provide monthly allowances to poor families, which will be provided in the places where people live according to the level of each equity card. Vulnerable and local. Such arrangements are made in accordance with the principle of equity and in response to differences in prices between regions.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that this allowance will be paid in the fourth week of each month through Wing Specialized Bank, which has a network of agents throughout the country.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that this social assistance program is not a permanent program. The Royal Government has organized this program to provide social assistance during the crisis of Kovid-19, with the opening ceremony being held every two months, with the first round being held once in June. And one July.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Royal Government will continue to monitor and evaluate the situation and the actual impact of Kovid-19. If the situation and effects of Kovid-19 persist and do not improve, the social assistance program will be implemented in a new round for two consecutive months.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that if the effects of Kovid-19 are alleviated, the Royal Government will stop this social assistance program and divert funds to invest in necessary work to restore and promote economic growth and improve people's livelihoods. People in general.
* Samdech Techo stated that the financial assistance program for poor families is designed to help solve the difficulties of the people during the people affected by Kovid-19 disease, but must also be avoided. Also, the establishment of living habits based entirely on subsidies from the Royal Government.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded that the courtesy of the Royal Government has just given us cash to distribute to people who face the shortage of Kovid 19
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Royal Government led by the Cambodian People's Party and under the leadership of Samdech himself will not leave any citizen to starve to death without attention.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Royal Government has already sent 125 million USD to the targets for 5 months to help people suffering from the disease 19
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia is a poor country that can not run after rich countries, able to provide a lot of support to the people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen instructed the relevant ministries and authorities to find 19 more people affected by Kovid.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in the past, only 560,000 families were found, but in the following months, more victims could be found, which requires additional costs.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Kovid 19 will bring those who cross the poverty line back to the poverty line
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that affected people can apply for support, but not all requests are accepted, must be examined thoroughly and accurately.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that now we have found 560,000 families in need, but in the future there will be more people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that if the affected people are found, the state can spend an additional 30 million to 50 million dollars, but must ensure that no one can die of starvation.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reacts to economic analysts criticizing the Royal Government's cash support to the people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen mocked the economic analysts who criticized this cash subsidy program, please tell their relatives not to accept this cash.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that this cash support program is an aid, not a fundraiser, because people still have access to other jobs.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen instructed the relevant authorities to pay cash to the people in June and July.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia is not like other countries, but the Royal Government has the manners to manage and lead the state and manage the budget. Therefore, the Royal Government has sufficient funds to support the people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the budget of $ 25 million per month is just the beginning, but if Kovid 19 extends the cost can increase to $ 30 million or more.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on people not to be overwhelmed with the support of the Royal Government to work hard to find more jobs.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen asked the people to see the efforts of the Royal Government to solve the crisis of the nation and the people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the program to provide cash support to poor women, pregnant women up to the age of 2 and workers during childbirth, as well as other health care programs is to be implemented permanently.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on the owners of private educational institutions to reduce the building rent with understanding and gentleness.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on the National Bank and other financial institutions to restructure loans for private educational institutions.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen encourages and supports banks to confiscate the property of debtors who follow the call of foreign opposition groups.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia is promoting the agricultural sector as rice exports increase.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia has no food insecurity.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen expects that cash support will facilitate the lives of the people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on people to continue to pay attention to fight against Kovid 19.
