A monk hanged himself without knowing the reason, the authorities are searching for the truth in Oddar Meanchey province
(Oddar Meanchey): A monk hanged himself without knowing the reason at Wat Tuol Sanam in O'Romduol village, Preah Prolay commune, Trapeang Prasat district, Oddar Meanchey province at 11:00 on June 23, 2020.
According to the report of the police of Trapeang Prasat district, it was confirmed that the monk who committed suicide by hanging was named Vorn Phearoeun, 20 years old, living at Wat Upper, his hometown in Village 3, Leu Commune, Chamkar Leu District, Kampong Cham Province. A 3.50-meter-long white nylon ox tied to a 2.46-meter-high beam and dragged himself down, causing him to strangle to death.
After the incident, the police and doctors went to examine the body and found the body wearing an orange blanket with a scar on the throat caused by a nylon cord, while the scene did not have any suspicious marks. Conclude that the body of the above monk really died because of the actual hanging.
