(Svay Rieng): In the opening ceremony of the orientation session on the management of the municipal administration of Svay Rieng province this morning, June 23, 2020, Mr. Men Vibol, Governor of Svay Rieng province, urged the municipal administration to be accountable to the Royal Government. And each ministry and institution for which it is responsible.
The event was attended by Deputy Governors, Provincial Administrative Directors, Directors of Provincial Public Works Departments, Chairmans of 8 Municipal Councils, 8 Deputy Governors, Heads of Offices and 13 Units under 8 Municipalities and Trainers. Two people from the National School of Local Administration, a total of 240 people attended.
