He added that the launch of the new structure of the municipal, district and Khan administration now has a deeper meaning to the administrative system at the sub-national level, such as:
* First, the administration of municipalities, districts, and Khans in accordance with the principles of a unified administration that is fully established to promote, promote and sustain democratic development at the sub-national level in accordance with the Law on the Administration of Capital, Provinces, Municipalities, Districts and Khans.
* Second, the change in the line of accountability and the mode of operation means that the municipal, district and khan administration, which represents the Royal Government and the ministries and institutions at its administrative level, must play a role in coordinating and directing all activities or tasks. Within its jurisdiction.
