Of the 3 million students, about 1.5 million are eligible for education services from the Ministry of Education, and another 1.5 million rely on textbooks, Dr. Hang Chuon Naron added.
Regarding the problem of about 30 percent of students who have not yet received this education service, Minister Hang Chuon Naron said that because they live far from school, in remote areas and living in poverty. Koh Kong Provincial Health Department Structure and Management System to be put into operation after the Royal Government decides to re-manage the province
