The new Phnom Penh International Airport project was announced during Chinese Premier Li Keqiang's visit to Cambodia in January 2018. Samdech Techo Hun Sen and Mr. Ly Ker Chheang also presided over the signing ceremony of the investment project between OCIC, Duke Pung Kheav Se and the Chinese company at that time.
