The ground floor has more than 500 parking spaces and a front yard for public parking for 300 cars. Upstairs is a public meeting hall for about 10,000 people.
The building has five floors, with a 3,000-square-meter hospitality hall that can seat more than 4,000 people, and a cafeteria on the south side of the building that can seat 120 people at a time. .
