This huge building is built with fancy Khmer style and has a beautiful aesthetic, attracting a lot of attention from the public.
The architects of the building point out that it was built under a new style called contemporary style due to the combination of three styles. The three styles are: Angkor Wat style, Banteay Srei style and Kandal style. The combination of these three styles is called "contemporary style".
