The inauguration ceremony was held in the presence of Mr. Pav Heng Dara, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Commerce and Mr. Tith Vuthy, Deputy Governor of Kampong Speu Province, with the participation of delegates, representatives of the Department of Commerce of the Capital and Provinces and representatives of Departments around the province and representatives of civil society organizations. Many more.
