On the night of June 20, 1977, Samdech Techo Hun Sen and four other warriors, including: Nuch Thorn, Nhek Huon, San Sanh and Vapo Ian, decided in the most difficult situation to travel the night out of command. Construction site of the 21st Battalion in Koh Thmor village, Tonlong commune, Memot district, Tbong Khmum province, towards Binh Phuoc province, Vietnam.
