But in the end, starting from this sharp will and great sacrifice, Samdech Techo Hun Sen achieved his goal by mobilizing patriotic forces and having the support of the Vietnamese army to overthrow the genocidal regime of Pol Pot and liberate his life. Khmer people all over the country successfully emerged from the brink of death on January 7, 1979.
Starting from the sacrifice and struggle by taking the life as the capital of Samdech Techo and this warrior, not only did the lives of the Cambodian people be restored to their rights and freedoms, but also brought about national unity, the end of the flames of war and development. Like now.
