The director of the provincial health department confirmed that the meeting was held for three main purposes, including:
* First: Update on the malaria situation, achievements, challenges and directions on the implementation of malaria eradication in Banteay Meanchey * Second: Update the provincial task force for malaria eradication * Third: Provision Recommendations and directions Next steps to achieve malaria eradication goals
