Mr. So Platon, Governor of Prasat Bakong District, said this morning, June 18, 2020, that after receiving an order from the provincial governor, the authorities and the police removed the mud pump from the Prasat Bakong temple because the authorities had used the machine in the past. Pumping water into the basin of Bakong temple to save the remaining fish, but still not achieved due to the large amount of mud in the basin.
He said that pumping mud from the basin of Bakong temple is very difficult because of the deep mud, which takes a lot of energy and time, however, must save the fish left in the basin.
He claimed that in the past, the authorities have already used three measures to save the fish: first: using a water truck to bring water into the basin, second: hitting a well to bring water into the basin, and third: using force. People protect to get rid of mud and have the support of Mr. Hang Sothy, who provided a large-scale pump and personal budget.
