The crackdown took place on June 16, 2020, on the occasion that the customs force at the Prek Chak International Border Crossing, in cooperation with professional officers and other relevant law enforcement forces, inspected some goods, fruits and food at the international gate. Prek Chak at the above location.
Mr. Yi Thol, Director of the Prek Chak International Gate Customs and Excise Office, said that this activity was carried out under the guidance and order of Mr. Heng Sambo, Chief of Kampot Provincial Customs and Excise Department to pay attention and inspect regularly. Goods and fruits are transported through this gate very carefully and strictly to maintain the well-being of the people.
"Whether today, tomorrow or the day ahead, the force will conduct regular inspections to ensure the health of all our people," Yithol said.
