He said that today, many kinds of fruits and vegetables were taken from the Prek Chak International Gate and the Tonle Sap Bilateral Gate for a series of experiments, with the only fruit being the Kulen fruit containing chemicals. In particular, gooseberries do not contain chemicals, and there are many other fruits that have been experimenting with chemicals.
