The two suspects were involved in an aggravated theft case (motorcycle accident) in Kampong Cham province and fled to Wat village, Tros commune, Romeas Hek district, Svay Rieng province.
After the arrest, the police checked the results and confiscated 10 motorcycles, including:
* 9 Honda C125 units * 1 Sumer X brand, including 1 motorcycle of the victim, Honda C125, made in 2017, black color, and confiscated a white Lexus 330 with license plate Phnom Penh 2AP-3890 No documents of the suspect who was involved in committing the crime, currently 1 car and 10 motorcycles are temporarily stored at the Romeas Hek District Police Inspectorate for further investigation in accordance with legal procedures.
