Mr. Mao Soeuth, Police Inspector of Chbar Ampov District, said that the incident occurred on June 14, 2020. The victim was named Mao Chinlong, male, 16 years old, a freelance worker living in Pang Luong Company, Sangkat Boeung Tumpun 1. Khan Meanchey was born in Khna village, Prey Toeng commune, Sithor Kandal district, Prey Veng province. Suspect's name is Sao Ken, male, 28 years old, driver, living in a rented house, Phum Tnot Chrum, Sangkat Boeung Tumpun 1, Khan Meanchey.
Since the above case was not a traffic accident, it was a criminal case, with the driver driving carelessly carrying almost 8 tons of glass material, the police arrested the suspect and sent him to the Chbar Ampov District Police Inspectorate for legal action.
Mr. Mao Soeuth said that after the autopsy, the body was handed over to the family to be taken to their hometown for a traditional ceremony. The suspect, Sao Ken, was sent to court on the morning of June 16, 2020 on charges of involuntary detention.
