(Takeo): After some people in Banteay Meanchey province were poisoned to death 7 people recently, the branch officials of Consumer Protection, Competition and Anti-Fraud (Takeo) in Takeo province on On June 15, 2020, in cooperation with the Provincial Department of Commerce, inspected some markets and liquor stores to find "Tang Kui" Chinese medicine wine, which contains toxic substances that endanger people's lives.
