The company has the wind oil to supply this processing plant from plantations (contract production with the people and units of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces) in Banteay Meanchey, Battambang, Pailin, Siem Reap and Oddar Meanchey provinces.
The company has received a permit from the Ministry of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries to export 50,000 tons of wood products or wood chips processed from wind oil, 2020-2021, and the company is completing the application form for export license for wood products. Or destroy 4,000 tons of processed wood from wind oil to Thailand through Phnom Dey, Sampov Loun district, Battambang province.
