(Phnom Penh): The Governor of Phnom Penh, Mr. Khuong Sreng, ordered the Deputy Governor in charge of Health, the Director of the Department of Health and the 14 District Governors to inspect and close the business immediately for dentists, dentists, illegal clinics and illegal pharmacies in their locality to Do not endanger the lives of the people.
During the announcement ceremony "Dissemination and operation of the Department of Health under the management structure of the Phnom Penh Capital Administration" on the afternoon of June 12, 2020, Mr. Khuong Sreng claimed that he currently observed that some businesses are operating in Phnom Penh. There may be some unauthorized and need to take immediate action.
Mr. Khuong Sreng said, "Some dentists or dentists are not professional, the health department must close all this. Now, Kovid 19, if you take an unprofessional dentist to see your teeth, it will be even more problematic, so the health department can eliminate it. The 14 districts must look at this issue, not just a dental problem, clinics without proper permits must be closed.
The Governor of Phnom Penh confirmed that the Department of Health must do this work to ensure that no crime occurs in Phnom Penh and the governors of the 14 districts must know exactly how many clinics are in their jurisdiction. With or without rules, this issue is not arbitrary.
At the same time, Mr. Khuong Sreng praised the operators who have a team of doctors in the 19th era of Kovid, Phnom Penh has the responsibility to treat patients until the praise from the region as well as from abroad.
