(Phnom Penh): Ms. Chan Sotheavy, Permanent Secretary of State, on behalf of Mr. Keut Rith, Minister of Justice, presided over the handover ceremony on the afternoon of June 12, 2020. Chou Bunrin has been appointed to replace Mr. Touch Tharith, who has been appointed as an advisor to the Ministry of Justice with the same status as the Director General.
The ceremony was held at the Phnom Penh Court of Appeal with the participation of Mr. You Bunleng, President of the Phnom Penh Court of Appeal, Mr. Ouk Savuth, Attorney General of the Phnom Penh Court of Appeal, Deputy President and Deputy Prosecutor, Judges, Prosecutors, Deputy Secretary General, Greffiers Officials of the Phnom Penh Court of Appeal and many other distinguished guests.
