(Phnom Penh): On June 12, 2020, the Court of Appeal and the Prosecutor's Office of the Phnom Penh Court of Appeal held a handover ceremony and assumed the position of Secretary General of the General Secretariat of Administration, with Mr. Chou Bunrin appointed to replace Mr. Touch Tharith. Appointed as an advisor to the Ministry of Justice with the rank of Director General.
According to the President of the Phnom Penh Court of Appeal, the six tasks include:
1: Must adhere to good work ethic in conjunction with the ability, good experience, promote the performance of subordinates with knowledge, knowledge, regular and full of responsibility to achieve justice. The parties are quick to follow the rules and flow of procedures set by law and set by the institution, such as regulations, minutes, resolutions and challenges, as well as principles of practice.
