(Phnom Penh): Mr. Sudirman Haseng, Ambassador of Indonesia to Cambodia, during a meeting with Senior Minister Sun Chanthol, Minister of Public Works and Transport recently, requested Senior Minister Sun Chanthol to help examine the feasibility of building a road. Named Indonesia's top leadership to highlight the strong and long-standing ties between the two countries.
