At the same time, the provincial governor also confirmed the airport project in Koh Kong district near the provincial town. . While the new location, she has not yet confirmed because the technical team is studying.
However, it is hoped that when the two airports are completed, they will further boost Koh Kong's economic growth through investment and tourism.
