Mr. Neth Pheaktra stated that in order to improve the efficiency of the management and conservation of natural resources and wildlife biodiversity of all kinds, the Ministry of Environment has prepared policies and action plans on the economic development of communities in protected areas in and around the area. Protect nature for a prosperous life.
The spokesman for the Ministry of Environment stated that in addition to the peace and development that Cambodia has now, we are helping to promote and increase the development of local communities. With the right policies of the Royal Government of Cambodia, the community will prosper in the future.
