(Central): Police in Takhmao City arrested a young man after he allegedly filmed three women bathing in a room on a brick floor. This incident happened on June 9, 2020 at the victim's bathroom in Khpob Veng village, Kampong Samnang commune, Takhmao city, Kandal province.
Police recounted that while the victim was taking a shower in his bathroom, the suspect, who lived in a rented house next door, stole his phone and stole a photo through a hole in the floor. When the victim saw and shouted, the suspect ran into his rented room.
The victim then told his mother and called the suspect out of the room and took the phone to check and saw the nude video. The victim's mother complained to the Kampong Samnang police station and the police intervened by detaining the suspect and sending the evidence to the Takhmao City Police Inspectorate for further action.
