On this occasion, Ms. O Vandin urged the provincial authorities to cooperate with the Department of Health to prevent the spread of Kovid 19, the second wave in the northeastern province. In addition, Ms. O Vandin said that Ratanakkiri is an important tourist destination, which today has a large influx of national and international visitors, and many tourists visiting the province are neglected to wear. The right mass.
