The distribution ceremony was held on Tuesday morning, June 09, 2020, accompanied by Mrs. Kheng Samvada, National Team Leader of Samrong Tong District, Mr. Vy Samnang, Provincial Governor, Mr. Sim Rattanak, Samrong Tong District Governor, Director of the Cambodian Red Cross Branch. Provinces, members of the provincial Red Cross branch and district Red Cross sub-branch.
