"Chrey Yus Resort" Sen Monorom City, Mondulkiri Province was cleared for illegal occupation, the provincial governor ordered professional officers and authorities to investigate and take immediate action
(Mondulkiri): The Governor of Mondulkiri Province, Mr. Svay Sam Eang, ordered the professional officers and relevant authorities to cooperate to investigate, prevent and take immediate action after the activities of a group of people entered the clearing to occupy illegally in "Chrey You Resort" is located in Sen Monorom City, Mondulkiri Province.
"Chrey You Resort" is a Phnom Prech wildlife sanctuary in Sen Monorom, rich in hundreds of years old chrey trees. The reaction and order of the Governor of Mondulkiri Province after the activities of traders to clear and set up illegal posts to seize land in the area until the arrest in the past.
According to the authorities, after being detained and detained for less than a week, the same group of traders also put in force to set up a fence post, and now they are Gather a group of people to protest in the form of victims.
Mondulkiri provincial officials said that occupying and clearing the area was completely illegal because some local officials in the villages and communes conspired and allowed them to do so. In this case, the provincial governor immediately ordered the authorities to cooperate with professional officers to prevent this activity from happening again, and if some local officials suspected of being involved in allowing these activities will be responsible. Before the law.
According to Mondulkiri provincial officials, for a "Chrey Yus resort", a company has asked the provincial governor for guidelines for the development and conservation of this ecotourism area to increase national and international tourist attraction.
