With only 22 days left, you will be fined (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): There are only 22 days left, from the 1st day onwards. From July 2020 onwards, business owners or vehicle owners who delay or do not renew the use of public services in the field of road transport for more than 30 days will be fined by the Ministry of Public Works and Transport. No exceptions.
What the Ministry of Public Works determines to renew the use of public services in the field of road transport includes:
* First: License to transport business * Second: Registration of vehicles with AT license plate * Third: Technical inspection of all types of vehicles and business technical inspection of vehicles * Fourth: driving license Certificate of competency for driving instructors and license for driving business.
Therefore, if the business owner or vehicle owner has not fulfilled these obligations, please hurry to complete it to avoid being fined.
