As usual, every Tuesday and Friday, on June 5, 2020, Mr. Mao Thunin, Governor of Pursat Province, used this mechanism to meet directly between the leaders as well as officials with the people to listen and solve problems. Up to 67 cases, all accepted, no loser, all win.
