Encourage the opening of training courses in units and according to the annual plan and request the Department of Personnel to make efforts to evaluate the discipline of the force in accordance with Regulation 006 of the National Police Force or the unit that has worked.
Finally, General Santebandit Neth Savoeun emphasized the work of directing the command, which determines the authority and mode of operation, receiving orders from the General Secretariat under the direction of the General Commissioner to the Commission or the unit under the General Commission of the National Police.
