He added that this is not the first time that the Royal Government team visited Sandan district, Kampong Thom province to visit local people. In fact, all working groups carried out various tasks before the government issued a directive on "monitoring, supporting and promoting the identification of poor households during the Kovid-19 epidemic."
Phnom Penh Capital Administration Decides to Suspend Santhor Mok Traffic Light for a while to relocate new traffic light poles
(Phnom Penh): The Phnom Penh Capital Administration has decided to temporarily suspend the operation of the Santhor Mok traffic light as the team relocates the new traffic light poles and runs a new underground network affected by the construction of the Santhor Mok pedestrian flyover. Therefore, the Phnom Penh Capital Administration asks the people who travel through the Santhor Mok traffic light to be tolerant.
On the afternoon of June 4, 2020, the Director of the Department of Public Works and Transport, Mr. Sam Piseth, called on the people who pass through the Santhor Mok traffic light to understand the tolerance for the temporary suspension of traffic lights due to the relocation. New traffic lights and a new underground network will be affected by the construction of the Santhor Mok pedestrian flyover.
Mr. Sam Piseth confirmed that the new traffic lights will resume next weekend, during this time, the traffic police and authorities will facilitate traffic for the people.
According to the plan, the pedestrian flyover in front of Santhor Mok Primary School will take six months to complete, to facilitate the movement of people and students to cross the road safely without facing any traffic accidents. Occurs eventually.
The pedestrian flyover in front of Santhor Mok Primary School will be built at the intersection of 4 roads, 2 lines across Mao Tse Tung Road and 2 lines across Kampuchea Krom Road to make it easier for students to cross this road safely. They come from either direction.
It should be noted that so far, Phnom Penh has 3 pedestrian flyovers, including: in the area of Chompou Voan, Khan Por Sen Chey, there are 2 places and in the area of Neang Kong Hing traffic light, there is 1 place.
According to the Phnom Penh Capital Administration project, this construction project will be expanded to more places in order to respond to a developed country and a civilized city and make it easier for people to cross the road safely.
Mr. Kong Vibol said that in June, the General Department of Taxation launched a new program, the e-Filling online declaration. This is one of the cornerstones of the Rectangular Strategy for Providing Taxpayer Services and Online Tax Management.
He added that the filing of tax returns online, with the preparation of the declaration of payroll tax, withholding tax, value added tax and so on. Therefore, the submission of this online declaration is a total of all types of taxes or enterprises that fill in the letter form every month to submit the declaration through this new system.
He added that after the launch of the E-Filling program, all taxpayers are no longer required to submit a declaration to the unit or the tax administration, but to enter into the system and enter their individual transactions. . Therefore, from this June, all taxpayers and enterprises can go online to submit declarations.
He said that for large and medium taxes, those taxpayers are required to submit a declaration through the E-Filling system, but if the average taxpayer has a problem, they can apply to the General Department of Taxation to work. Mediation can delay our mutual understanding. Therefore, the average taxpayer will be able to submit the declaration in the normal form to the tax branch or scan the taxpayer documents entered through the system of monthly declaration recipients.
He added that in the past, the General Department of Taxation has organized various workshops to make taxpayers better understand the program, as well as videos on the General Department of Taxation's website and Facebook on procedures and instruction on how to use it. This system. Therefore, the public can access these videos to get more details, and if not clear, please submit a request to the General Department of Taxation to train other knowledge as well.
He said that June is an important month and the first time that the General Department of Taxation has already organized the E-Filling program, which the public has always been waiting for and wanting to avoid any complications.
Sihanoukville Military Arrests Indonesian Man in Drug Confiscation
