Samdech Vibol Sena Pheakdey Say Chhum congratulated the nine ladies and gentlemen on their appointment as new ambassadors to the nine countries, which is a personal honor for the family, society and nation. During this diplomatic mission, the President of the Senate instructed the nine ladies to pay attention to the following:
