Fisheries We have 22 fishing communities, 2 fisheries conservation areas, 40 fishing community conservation areas, 55 community fish ponds, 91 family fish ponds, 22 frog ponds, 211 hatcheries, 5 fish hatcheries, 36 ponds. 43 ponds and 4 fish farming business clusters, 4 fish processing business clusters.
Mineral Resources Work: 8 construction stone companies, 7 active sites: 1 site under construction, 1 Ministry of Red Land business license site, 2 provincial sites, 17 provincial land exploration sites, 107 provincial mobile earth pit sites and 5 metal mining companies.
