He added that after they listened to the descriptions of the two children and reported to the police, the police immediately came down to arrest the suspect, who was the false grandfather, and called the girl's parents. The accident in Battambang province was reported and a complaint was also filed.
The district inspector said that the suspect's grandfather was named Bou Seng, 76 years old, a farmer, while the victim girl was named K.S.M., an 8-year-old female student living in the commune. Based on the suspect's confession and the doctor's confirmation, the suspect was sent to the provincial police for legal action. In the first 5 months of the year, 125 customers won 5 million Riel from WURKZ
