* 1: The general work principle is based on the five major tasks that the Ministry has already set out, which was further supported by the Prime Minister during the closing ceremony earlier this year. In that, care must be taken to protect the fundamental interests of the nation and its people, that is, to protect the territorial integrity from being violated, to encroach on illegal use, to protect sovereignty, independence, prestige, and national honor from being violated.
* Second: Contribute to the growth of our national economy through the implementation of diplomacy, economy, tourism and culture. He added that no country can succeed if it does not put economic issues at its core as its first agenda. Our Embassy Mission is tasked with promoting Cambodia to become a popular destination for investment and tourism, promoting Cambodian products, culture, history, and Khmer culture widely.
* 3: Manage the mission well. He says the mission is not big, not many staff officers, but the work there is multi-faceted. Therefore, it is required for the head of the mission to have a high level of leadership, discipline and clear ethics in managing the work and living in harmony with the staff and subordinates.
