Suspect's name is Ny Samnang, 16 years old. Occupation: Marketing staff. Residence: 84, Street 514, Village 13, Sangkat Boeung Kak I, Khan Toul Kork. Sangkat Choam Chao, Khan Por Sen Chey.
Mr. Bun Satya described that on the day of the incident, the suspect was playing an online game around Kos Doung Market, Sangkat Toek Laak 3, Khan Toul Kork, and after losing all his money, he had the idea to rob people's motorbikes to continue playing the game.
At that time, the suspect called the victim as a motodup driver in front of the internet game venue to take him to Camko City, Sangkat Tuol Sangke 2, Khan Russey Keo. The victim stopped the motorcycle and the suspect walked into the mart in front of the commune hall, bought a knife, hid it in his shirt and then let the victim continue.
When the victim, the suspect, arrived at the scene and saw that there were no people, the suspect used a knife hidden in his shirt to cut the victim, causing him to bleed and seriously injure the victim. The suspect threw the knife and picked up the victim's motorcycle and fled.
