Overall, the development plan for the Northwest and Provincial Tourism Road Map around the Tonle Sap Lake is indeed a new opportunity for tourism for the benefit of both tourists and investors in tourism to be a beacon of new ideas in the organization. The joint tour package will make it easier for tourists to travel to these areas in the future.
