(Banteay Meanchey): Two people were killed and another was seriously injured in a traffic accident between an ice truck and a motorcycle at 6:20 am on June 1, 2020 on National Road 5. At the point of Srah Deum Ampil in Teuk Thla Village, Sangkat Teuk Thla, Serey Sophorn City, Banteay Meanchey Province.
The victim, Phon Saruon, 60, of Nimit Village, Sangkat Nimit, Poipet City, died at the scene, while the passenger, Bun Sarath, 31, of the same village, died at the hospital and the driver of the ice truck was seriously injured. Roeun Chuy, 21, left Kampong Thom village, Kampong Svay commune, Serey Sophorn city, Banteay Meanchey province.
