Samdech Techo Hun Sen: Preah Sihanouk Province has become a multi-national development province and a potential economic pole for Cambodia (Video inside) (Preah Sihanouk): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, on the afternoon of June 1, 2012. 2020 claims that Sihanoukville, a potential economic pole for Cambodia, has become a multinational development province that has been investing heavily there.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen Remarks During a Meeting with Officials and Technical Team for Road Infrastructure Construction in Sihanoukville, Preah Sihanouk Province Otres and Ochheuteal beaches.
According to the Prime Minister, the reason why Sihanoukville has become a multinational development city is because Japan helped build deep-sea ports, France developed airports, China and Malaysia developed power plants and companies More build hotels and restaurants.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen added that in the future, Sihanoukville could become a financial center as well, claiming that some islands in Cambodia are now almost more expensive than one country, but there are still tourists to visit. According to Samdech Techo, Sihanoukville has two special economic zones, one of which is invested by China and the other by Japan.
It should be noted that due to the rapid development in Sihanoukville, Samdech Techo Hun Sen has inspired the construction of 34 luxury roads. As of June 1, 2020, 94% of these roads have been built.
Key Remarks by Samdech Techo Hun Sen in a Conversation with Officials and Technical Team for Road Infrastructure Construction in Sihanoukville
(Phnom Penh): On the afternoon of June 1, 2020, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, met with officials and technical team to build road infrastructure in Sihanoukville after inspecting road construction in In Sihanoukville.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen spoke for more than 3 hours with the following key points:
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen commended the engineering team and the construction team of all private companies for their joint efforts to complete the construction of all 34 roads faster than planned.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen sent a message to visit more than 4,000 workers who worked on the construction of 34 roads and donated 100,000 Riels per person.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reiterated that the reason for the decision to open the construction of 34 roads in Sihanoukville is after Samdech saw that the road in Sihanoukville does not fit the growing height of the building.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen confirmed that the investment in infrastructure construction in Sihanoukville is now about 340 million dollars
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Cambodian economic poles now have three: Phnom Penh, Siem Reap and Sihanoukville. Samdech Techo Hun Sen hopes that Cambodia will have another fourth economic pole in the Northeast
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Sihanoukville is a province with severe infrastructure damage, which is why Samdech decided to build a road in Sihanoukville.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the construction of luxury roads in Sihanoukville, including the construction of beautiful beaches, will become more attractive to tourists to this southwestern province.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he was really pleased with the infrastructure achievements in Sihanoukville.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that tourists will be able to visit the streets in Sihanoukville, and Samdech urged the provincial governor to decorate the streets and beautiful lighting.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked Deputy Prime Minister Chea Sophara, Senior Minister Sun Chanthol, Mr. Thong Khon and all relevant authorities for their efforts in achieving infrastructure in Sihanoukville.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked the people for their cooperation and understanding for the construction of the road, including the improvement of the beach.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen encourages the installation of more smart lights on the streets in Sihanoukville.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in the future, not only Sihanoukville but other cities will also need to install smart lights to reduce electricity consumption.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that previously it was not possible to connect the road from Otres Beach to Ochheuteal Beach, but now it is reconnected after a private land owner agreed to return the land to the Royal Government for road construction. Connect.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked the people for cooperating with the authorities for the preparation and connection of the beach in Sihanoukville.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen requested the authorities to continue to control the sewage system so as not to damage the beach and sea.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the main goal for Sihanoukville is to become a multi-purpose city.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Sihanoukville is equipped with more security cameras than Phnom Penh, which has nearly 600 locations
