The following is a list of the 173 countries and territories that show the total number of cases, deaths and cures from COVID-19: Stung Sdao Bridge in Sangkum Thmei District, Preah Vihear Province, which was destroyed by fire, is nearing completion. Provincial Public Works Department is working to get it up and running as soon as possible
(Preah Vihear): Stung Sdao Bridge is located in Soch Village, Sdao Commune, Sangkum Thmei District, Preah Vihear Province. .
On the afternoon of June 1, 2020, Mr. Kor Sum Bunsoeut, Acting Governor of Preah Vihear Province, accompanied by Mr. Samleang Try, Director of Preah Vihear Provincial Department of Public Works and Transport, together with Mr. Sangkum Thmey District Governor. Mr. Ben Davis, an American who is conserving the wildlife of Phnom Pok, Phnom Tnaot and many other officials, inspected the progress of the construction of the bridge across the Sdao River.
On behalf of Mr. Prak Sovann, Governor of Preah Vihear Province, Mr. Ko Sum Bunsoeut congratulated this new achievement which will soon benefit the people. The acting governor thanked the director of the provincial Department of Public Works and Transport and his subordinates, as well as local authorities, for their efforts to rebuild the bridge, replacing the burnt-out wooden bridge.
Separately, Mr. Samleang Try said that the Stung Sdao bridge was rebuilt with steel ball and wooden floor, 48 meters long and 4.2 meters wide. This bridge serves the interests of the people of 3 villages: Soch village, Trapeang Thlok village and Ta Bao village in Sdao commune, beyond the Phnom Tnaot Phnom Pok wildlife conservation area.
The Director of the Department underlined that the new steel ballast bridge across the Sdao River is supported by Senior Minister Sun Chanthol, Minister of Public Works and Transport, and supported by Mr. Say Sam Al, Minister of Environment and Steel Pillars. By Senior Minister Meas Sophea and Mr. Prak Sovann and the construction work carried out by the Provincial Department of Public Works and Transport does not have the budget of any other philanthropist.
