The importance of breast milk and how to choose a nutritious or nutritious milk for children and babies
(Phnom Penh): Breast milk is best for babies, but some mothers choose formula instead of breast milk for two reasons: First, some mothers have to work to provide more life like this. No time to breastfeed.
Reason 2: Poor maternal health or insufficient milk, which requires the mother to eat nutritious food and a balanced diet every day, such as good protein, carbohydrates, vitamins and minerals and should avoid food. Dangers such as alcohol and spoiled food and avoid bad environment such as cigarette smoke, air pollution and chemicals. But really hard!
According to a nutritionist and CEO of NCNC, "Currently, we have studied the market situation in Cambodia and found that the ingredients in milk powder range from 25 to 55. "The difference is huge because of the price of the ingredients."
If you add ingredients, the price will be more expensive. "So we found the difference between the price and the ingredients. "Cheap milk powder usually has between 25 and 30 ingredients, and expensive milk powder has between 50 and 55 ingredients." If your child is healthy, choose a product that has a lot of ingredients among products that have a similar price.
According to nutritionists, infants consume only milk, in which 80% of brain cells grow during the first two years. If the ingredients are not enough, it can affect the development of the brain, the immune system, growth and other diseases.
