(Kratie): The Kratie Provincial Armed Forces, in cooperation with the Forestry Administration of Sangkat Snuol, on the morning of May 30, 2020, cracked down on an unlicensed timber truck in Charchar Village, Kranhong Sen Chey Commune, Snuol District, Kratie Province.
A military official told Fresh News that the truck was carrying full load of timber from Keo Seima district, Mondulkiri province, passing behind the company Lay Thursday to reserve for sale in Vietnam, but arrived at the rubber plantation in the commune. Competent to crack down immediately.
Mr. Phong Khun Lay, Chief of Snuol Forestry Administration Sangkat, confirmed to Fresh News Agency in Kratie Province this afternoon that this recycling truck was carrying sokrum wood and full of trucks without any permission. Take this car and leave it at the wedding park to be measured and handled according to the law of the Forestry Administration.
The Royal Government Working Group visited Kampong Thom Province and the Minister of Environment solved the problem of farmland for the people of Tang Kork District in the Whistle Conservation Area and Area 3
(Kampong Thom): The Royal Government's working group visited Kampong Thom province with Mr. Thong Khon, Minister of Tourism as the Chairman, and Mr. Say Sam Al, Minister of Environment and Mr. Sok Loo, Governor of Kampong Thom Province on May 30, 2020. Conversation and solving the problem of land use in "Oulou area" for the people in Taing Kork district, while the location of the problem land is in both the Whisper Conservation Area and 3 areas of Treal Commune, Taing Kork District.
