Minister Thong Khon also explained to the people that the Royal Government's working group visited Kampong Thom province, the Ministry of Environment and the authorities did not leave the people in distress, but knew how to deal with it properly and all for the benefit of all the people. But in order for this solution to be effective, the Ministry and the Department of Environment, as well as local authorities, need to comply with legal procedures to avoid causing problems to the people later.
At the same time, Mr. Sok Lou, as the local authority, is also committed to assisting and resolving with the people to mediate whenever the people need the authorities to help and have other requests from the local authorities. Can help.
Minister Thong Khon and Minister Say Sam Al promised the people that they would meet again in the next two months to inaugurate the community after the people were formed and bring solutions to the people.
