(Stung Treng): Mr. Mom Saroeun, Governor of Stung Treng Province, on May 30, 2020, led the civil servants and the Governor of Borey O'Svay District and the Governor of Siem Pang District to plant palm seeds on the road at the junction of Siem Pang District Town towards the road. 100,000 Cambodia-Laos border lines at the "Oku" point.
