Minister of Public Works inspects work in provincial departments around Tonle Sap
(Kampong Chhnang): During the visit to inspect the duties of the 7 Provincial Department of Public Function in the area around the Tonle Sap Lake, Mr. Prum Sokha, Minister of Public Works and colleagues spent two days on the 28th and 29th. May 2020, starting from Kampong Thom to Siem Reap, then Banteay Meanchey, Battambang, Pailin, Pursat to Kampong Chhnang.
In addition to inspecting the condition of buildings, places, means of work, the Minister and his colleagues also met and encouraged all civil servants who are working in each department, emphasizing the importance of duties, duties and responsibilities of the function. The public is an indispensable player in the implementation of the policy of public administration reform within the framework of territorial administration at the sub-national level.
The Minister requested the councils and governors of each province in their jurisdiction to consider the Department of Public Works as a strong support for the successful implementation of the Royal Government's Rectangular Political Program and Strategy on priority sector reform. Public administration reform, decentralization and deconcentration reform, public financial reform, judicial and judicial reform, etc.
In the current situation where the country is facing the global crisis of Kovid 19, the provincial administration and all levels of provincial authorities, especially the Department of Public Works, must set an example in participating in the fight against Kovid 19 through effective implementation in a spirit of economy. High utilization of staffing, state budget, absolute avoidance of waste, waste of human resources and national financial resources.
Overcome all difficulties, work twice as hard, firmly believe that our national unity force under the wise leadership of the Royal Government, headed by Samdech Techo Hun Sen, we have indeed defeated Kovid 19 and overcome all Difficulties as a result of the Kovid 19 revolution bring our society back to normalcy quickly for the cause of peace and development for the glorious future of this generation and the next.
