* First: the fight against Kovid 19 * Second: the work of maintaining security and public order * Third: the work of solving the effects of the Kovid 19 crisis, especially the identification of the poor, * Fourth: reform work * Fifth: Public service delivery work * 6: Strengthen the working system of officials.
