The Ministry of Interior decided to register the "Cambodian Alumni Association from Harbin University of Technology" in the association list
(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Interior has decided to register the Cambodian Alumni Association of Harbin University of Technology, located at C39, Village 1, Sangkat Srah Chak, Khan Daun Penh, Phnom Penh, to register with the Ministry of Interior.
