(Phnom Penh): Doing business always wants to get a profit back, so knowledge related to the tax system is very important for business people, employees who hold positions in accounting and finance or business owners.
The Cambodian Taxation Curriculum at CAMED will provide the necessary knowledge for accountants, auditors and professional accountants working in Cambodia, such as:
All the professors at CAMED have a degree and a clear expertise in Cambodian taxation. Therefore, you will get both theory and practice in the Cambodian tax system, plus other benefits.
In particular, it is a method of calculating tax payments accurately in accordance with the framework of Cambodian tax law, with no shortage or excess, but will also save the company's business profits. Every Saturday or Sunday for five months.
The Cambodian Taxation Certificate is an internationally recognized degree by the Association of Professional Accountants (ACCA) in the United Kingdom and by the National Accounting Council of the Ministry of Economy and Finance.
In addition, those with a degree will be exempt from the F6 exam, a tax law subject of the UK's ACCA International Curriculum.
