(Phnom Penh): Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of Interior and Chairman of the National Committee for Combating Human Trafficking (NEC), presided over the dissemination of the 2019 National Report and 2020 Orientation. Of the National Committee for Combating Human Trafficking.
