* For the suppression and rescue of victims, the General Commissioner of the National Police, the National Gendarmerie and 22 Capital / Provincial Police Commissions monitored and investigated 169 out of 134 cases of human trafficking and sexual exploitation. In 35 cases, accounting for 26.11 percent, 229 out of 224 suspects were arrested, including 72 women, including 11 minor suspects and 40 foreigners of 7 nationalities.
131 out of 95 cases of sexual exploitation were suppressed, 168 suspects were arrested, including 34 women, 10 minors, 34 foreigners and 305 victims were rescued.
