The Thai Ambassador expressed his deep congratulations to Samdech Techo for setting out realistic measures to prevent the spread of Kovid 19. He said that the measures taken by Samdech were highly effective and prevented the outbreak.
The embassy also advised all Thai companies to adhere to the Ministry of Health's guidelines to prevent the spread of Kovid 19.
In response to the sympathy of the Royal Government of Thailand, Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked the Royal Government as well as the Thai people for their assistance and cooperation in preventing Kovid 19 with Cambodia. Samdech Techo considered the gesture of the Royal Government of Thailand as a reflection of the solidarity between Cambodia and Thailand.
On this occasion, Samdech Techo Prime Minister highly appreciated the measures taken by the Royal Government of Thailand to prevent Kovid 19.
Samdech Techo, the head of the Royal Government, also highlighted that the measures set by the Royal Government of Thailand are realistic. As a testament to the Thai government's effective measures, when more than 90,000 Cambodians crossed the Thai border into Cambodia in the past, no one was infected or brought 19 cases of Kovid. Cambodia.
The Prime Minister added that this aspect is a reflection that Thailand is not a country that transmits Kovid disease.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen also confirmed to the Thai side the efforts of the Cambodian Embassy in Thailand to contribute to the fight against Kovid 19 with Thailand. Samdech Techo stated that the Cambodian Ambassador to Thailand is working with the Cambodian people living in Thailand to implement the principles of the Royal Government of Thailand set out to prevent the spread of Kovid 19.
In addition, today, Samdech has just decided that Cambodians holding Cambodian passports can return to Cambodia without the need for a health certificate. But must follow the guidelines of the Royal Government when returning to Cambodia.
Samdech Techo also said that now is the time to unite in the fight against diseases that the enemy has no shadow.
In this meeting, Samdech Techo Prime Minister thanked the Ambassador for paying homage to the deceased of his mother-in-law and brought the visit and condolences of Prime Minister Prayuth Chan Ou Cha to Samdech and his family.
Raising natural bees in Romeas Hek district, Svay Rieng province is very interesting, 80,000 Riel per liter
According to Mr. Touch Srey, a 40-year-old male, the head of the Trapeang Disabled Natural Beekeeping Community, the beekeeping started from December 2019 to May 2020, six months ago.
This bee breed is an Italian bee breed that is supported and provided by the Provincial Department of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries in the program of the Ministry of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries. More than $ 7,000.
Mr. Touch Srey continued that raising natural bees for 15 days, harvesting 23 barrels at a time, 45 liters of honey per month, 90 liters of honey per month, and 1 liter of honey costs 80,000 Riel or 1 and a half liter bottles. 40,000 riels. The proceeds from the sale of honey are to support the Forest Patrol Commission.
There are 9 members of the Forestry Committee, one of whom is an accountant, and the community does not yet have the budget to support or support, but works voluntarily. And the natural forest has a mix of trees on a total area of 444 hectares and has a variety of vines and plants, flowers and fruits change during the dry season.
According to Mr. Touch Srey, bees are a species that live in a community ruled by a single queen bee. . As for the Italian breeds of bees that experts have captured in this technical breeding tank, in each barrel there is a queen bee, a bee, a bee, a hive guard, 5 hive bees and 10,000 worker bees.
If any worker bees bring poisonous pollen to the front of the container or in front of the hive, they will be bitten and killed immediately, and bees from other communities or from other hive will be bitten and killed immediately.
Amethyst bees, on the other hand, are larger than worker bees, and all worker hive bees will recognize the poisonous flowers. He said that the queen bee ordered the worker bees to find food to feed the queen bee and to feed the Amat and the worker bees and to find water and pollen to produce honey.
There is only one queen bee, no queen bee, and the queen bee is at least 2 years old, dead, and before she dies, she gives birth if there are male bees and a barrel or a hive if there are many male bees. Only 30 were bitten to death to continue the breeding of the queen bee after the male bees have bred the female queen and the female bee kills all the male bees immediately.
