(Phnom Penh): For 26 days of tightening the road traffic law by increasing the fine according to Sub-Decree No. 39, that is, on May 1-26, 2021, the traffic police throughout the country inspected and fined 38,189 vehicles in That 27812 motorcycles and 10377 cars of all kinds. This was confirmed by Lt. Gen. Chhay Kim Khoeun, Deputy Commissioner General and spokesman for the National Police General Commission, to Fresh News.
