(Svay Rieng): Mr. Khuon Ra and his family who suffered from a house fire on May 24, 2020 in Srah Vong Village, Sangkat Svay Rieng, Svay Rieng City raised their hands in tears to express their deep gratitude. Care from Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia and Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen.
On May 26, 2020, Ms. Kittiprit Dr. Ouk Maly, Representative of Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen and Samdech Techo Prime Minister, led by Ms. Kittisangkhab Dr. Men Sam An, was assigned to bring budget and supplies including food to Mr. Khuon Ra's family.
Khuon Ra, 50, an official at Svay Rieng Provincial Court, said: "Although my house was on fire, I was in a lot of trouble, but I still have the courage and hope to get help again. The huge can not be priced from Samdech Puk Samdech Mey (Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia and Samdech Kittiprittbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen).
At the same time, Ms. Kittisangkhab Dr. Men Sam An, on behalf of the Chairman of the National Working Group and Chairman of the Party Strengthening Committee in Svay Rieng Province, said, "We would like to express our deep gratitude to Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister and Samdech Kittiprittbandit. "Bun Rany Hun Sen, who took care of and immediately donated money and materials to the people affected by the house fire after I made a report to the prince."
Ms. Kittisangha Bandith continued that the Prince always thinks sympathetically and alleviates the suffering of the poor people, especially to government officials who suffer from natural disasters or fires, etc. "I really thank you very much. "
At the same time, Ms. Kittisanghabandit also instructed the families of the above victims to take the money that the prince helped to build a house as soon as possible to get shelter for their families and children, and do not neglect anything like the above case. Always be vigilant and check for flammable appliances in our homes.
Please be informed that this fire occurred on the evening of May 24, 2020 at 5:40 AM in Srah Vong Village, Sangkat Svay Rieng, Svay Rieng City, destroying a wooden house under a galvanized roof, 8 meters by 16 meters wooden wall. Cut the wire.
