(Phnom Penh): General Him Yan, Deputy Commissioner General and Representative of General Dr. Neth Savoeun, National Police Commissioner, praised all the forces for their efforts to protect the security and public order of the people, especially the crime. In general, as in the case of traffic accidents, there is a significant decrease.
