(Phnom Penh): The Cambodian Red Cross on May 25, 2020 donated $ 1 million to Kantha Bopha Hospital through the Kantha Bopha Foundation of Cambodia, chaired by Samdech Techo Hun Sen and Samdech Kittiprittbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen. Honor.
