(Koh Kong): Mr. Veng Sakhon, Minister of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries and Ms. Mithona Phu Thong, Governor of Koh Kong Province, expressed their support and encouragement for the conservation of rare and endangered turtles, and especially animals. Geography of land transport in Koh Kong province.
