In order to facilitate the family life during the sick leave of the three branch officers, Mr. Thong Savun provided the branch's budget and his own budget, the CPPCC budget and contributions from branch members and philanthropists. Others to the three branch officials who were seriously injured, each receiving 1,450,000 Riels. Separately, a reporter from the provincial information department suffered minor injuries and received 950,000 riels.
