(Preah Vihear): The Preah Vihear Provincial Administration has issued a notice to all restaurant and restaurant owners in Preah Vihear to participate in the prevention and control of the spread of Kovid 19 more effectively.
According to the announcement of the Preah Vihear Provincial Administration, which was received by Fresh News on the afternoon of May 22, 2020, the provincial administration noted that after 19 cases of Kovid were cured in Cambodia, the people There is no fear and loss of vigilance 19 Kovid, and in some restaurants and canteens, both restaurant owners and guests are not careful, not following the instructions of the Ministry of Health as before.
Therefore, in order to prevent and control the spread of Kovid 19 more effectively, the Preah Vihear Provincial Administration would like to advise all restaurant owners to be careful as follows:
* First, to comply with the instructions of the Ministry of Health on the plan to prevent the spread of Kovid 19 * Second: Prepare alcohol or gel for hand washing in front of the entrance and arrange staff to measure Warm up all guests before and allow them to enter the restaurant or canteen * Third: Keep the social gap properly according to the guidelines of the Ministry of Health.
In case any restaurant owner does not follow this instruction, the provincial administration will temporarily close the restaurant business.
