(Phnom Penh): More than 10 large packages of drugs, including 1 package of white powder, were confiscated from a female suspect in a search operation by the Russey Keo District Military Police.
The suspect was arrested on the afternoon of May 20, 2020 at house number 133, group 14, Phsar Touch village, Sangkat Toul Sangke 1, Khan Russey Keo, named Sam Theavy, female, 53 years old. They confiscated 10 packs of white gram, 1 big pack of white powder, scales for weighing drugs, bags for drug ports and some drug paraphernalia.
Currently, the above suspects have been sent to the Drug Crimes Investigation Office of the Phnom Penh Municipal Gendarmerie to build a case and send it to the court for legal proceedings.
