The Meanchey District Military Base said that the arrest was made according to the complaint of the suspect's mother, Chan Net, 60 years old. Sources from the scene confirmed that the suspect was addicted to drugs and he always caused endless problems until the family, especially his mother, was so upset that he could not bear to file a complaint to the military. Detain immediately.
Currently, the suspect was sent by the Meanchey District Armed Forces to the Drug Crimes Investigation Office of the Phnom Penh Municipal Gendarmerie for questioning and to build a case to be sent to court for sentencing.
