On March 26, 2020, Mr. Rom Sovichea was also issued the first warning letter by Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of Interior, due to negligence in performing his duties. If they continue to act contrary to this instruction, they will definitely take action according to the discipline of the National Police Force.
Strict and disrespectful actions against the National Police officers in charge of the Land Traffic Office of Kampong Thom Provincial Police by Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng and National Police Commissioner General Neth Savoeun were fully applauded and supported. Of government officials, law enforcement forces and the people, especially those who have been injured and hurt by this police officer.
