ACLEDA Bank Plc. Will be officially listed on the Cambodia Securities Exchange on 25 May
The listing of ACLEDA Bank Plc. Is the turning point of the bank's successful history as the first commercial bank in Cambodia to be listed on the Cambodia Securities Exchange.
By participating in the public offering of ACLEDA Bank Plc., Investors, individuals and legal entities have the opportunity to invest for the first time in a commercial bank registered in Cambodia.
The Bank's new public shareholders will benefit from the Bank's growth through dividends and capital gains. The public offering of ACLEDA Bank Plc. Has attracted many Cambodian natural investors to invest in the Cambodia Securities Exchange and will continue to contribute to the development of the Cambodian Capital Market.
We are honored and pleased to be involved in this important project as the Bank's sole financial advisor and to contribute to the development of the Cambodia Securities Exchange.
We believe that ACLEDA Bank Plc. Has taken the important first step to become a real bank by issuing its initial public offering.
As the leader of this important project, Yanta will continue to assist all publishers and public investors by increasing the liquidity of bank shares in the secondary market.
