The provincial governor is also working urgently, ordering local authorities, the armed forces, and all relevant officials to take immediate action, announcing to residents or traders Occupation and construction of houses in the territory of the above Royal Decree requesting the immediate demolition, effective from May 15, 2020 to June 15, 2020, for a limited period of 30 days.
