* Group 2: Disseminate to all people living in the Royal Decree to dismantle as determined in the deadline * Group 3: Identify targets and take legal action against the 10 ringleaders Involvement in the case of encroachment on the above Royal Decree * Group 4: A group that erected additional Royal Decree posts, with one additional pole per kilo, but the Fourth Commission has not yet taken action. .
The provincial governor also stated that those who violated the Royal Decree could not be tolerated. The flooded forest, which is the second and third areas, is now being cleared, destroyed and encroached upon by squatters.
